# Phase 5: Tests

## Overview

Comprehensive test suite for all 3 Intelligence Layer components + pipeline integration. Validates asset class schema, portfolio optimization logic, search rewriting, and quality scoring updates.

## Requirements

- Functional: Test every component independently + integration
- Non-functional: All tests run without network. No web calls. <30s total runtime.

