## Risk Assessment

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| Import path issues (scripts in different dirs) | Use same sys.path pattern as test_leverage_scoring.py |
| Flaky Monte Carlo tests (random) | Seed random with fixed seed in tests |
| Asset class JSON changes break tests | Tests check structure, not specific values (except counts) |
